{'question': 'Question Text: How much taller is Mount St. Kibo than the combined height of Mount St. Martha and Glencoe Peak?
Question Text: \begin{tabular}{|c|c|} \hline Mountain & Height (metres) \\ \hline Kibo & \( 12,388 \) \\ \hline St. Martha & \( 8,368 \) \\ \hline Glencoe Peak & \( 1,344 \) \\ \hline \end{tabular}
